  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.1.0 - Initial Release\n            - Complete IFileStorage implementation for AWS S3\n            - Pre-signed URL generation\n            - Server-side encryption (AES-256)\n            - Storage class support (Standard, IA, Glacier)\n            - Public read ACL support\n            - Thumbnail generation and caching in S3\n            - Object metadata for file information\n            - Advanced search and pagination",
